ection that exposes real tools and data.\n\nSkills, MCP, and the Agent SDK aren't competing approaches—they're complementary tools for different needs, with the ecosystem designed to grow from simple tools to sophisticated multi-agent systems."],"durationSeconds":13.006510460999793,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8a07933c-e38b-4d03-8b14-748320ca36d9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"765011f8-593a-4a93-978e-62232d6bbb2c","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"calm-watching-seal"}
